RANK: STATECELL-MARGIN-RQ | position=1 | reason=Only proposal whose curvature (99th-pct encoder norm) and per-level margin (median nearest-code distance) are measured, avoiding the fixed c=1 regime that E6/E7 show collapsing (l1_br recall 0.04671, T1/T2/T3 NLL 0.00/0.00/0.00, T4 9.03 vs l1_br_euclid 0.06207), and its successor-code margin attacks exactly the depth-2/3 prefix bottleneck (gold prefix alive 0.829/0.161, T2/T3 NLL 3.22/4.36) with a cap consistent with E8 (K=256 co-location 0.0822 vs 0.0129) and E11 (0.0907 vs null 0.067).
RANK: succframe-warp-rq | position=2 | reason=Real one-pathway coupling (determinant-one warp inside every level's distance and reconstruction term) with warp strength derived from successor-second-moment eigenvalue share, which E5 supports (top-1 mass 0.4375 vs 0.0543 across entropy quintiles), but fixed c=1 with r_max=1-1e-3 artanh clipping is the configuration E6/E7 show to degenerate, and its frame is refreshed per epoch (non-stationary) with only a post-hoc identity-frame check.
RANK: SUCCFRAME-MOEB-RQ | position=3 | reason=Coupling is genuine and cheap (1.02-1.10x baseline) but each encoding step is a Mobius isometry, so items with similar anchors get a translated codebook (relabeling) and only per-item anchor spread breaks the no-op; fixed c=1 again, tau=atanh(0.5) and rho=0.5 are documented defaults rather than measured, the geodesic loss replaces the baseline loss (an attribution confound one run cannot separate), and E5/E10 (mean out-degree 5.45, tail 2.7 successors) make the near-origin degenerate anchor common.
RANK: beh-aniso-poincare-rq | position=4 | reason=Scope-valid but mildest geometry: fixed c=1, beta in [0,1] bounds the stretch at sqrt(2) along a single direction, which E8 (6.4x lift but only 0.0822 absolute co-location at K=256) implies is too weak to change prefix membership, and the tangent Frechet codebook update risks usage collapse seen as the bundle's own risk; smallest geometric change matches its smallest stated cost (<5% wall clock).
OBJECTION: The frozen target 0.065 is above every arm in the bundle (best resample 0.06363, l1_only 0.06233), so all four candidates are being asked to beat the evidence ceiling on a single run whose seed noise is unmeasured; the winning proposal additionally rests on a detached, one-epoch-stale code cache whose self-referential successor-code distribution can oscillate or collapse items onto hot cells, and because no ablation arm is trained, the behaviour-on/geometry-on coupling cannot be demonstrated within the round — only argued from E6/E7/E8.
